OHOS: write the picked file in place when the save dialog's grant refuses a
sibling temp file. docs, slides and pdf save through this helper; the dialog
grants this app access to the picked file only, so the sibling temp file is
refused with EPERM and atomicWriteFile/atomicWriteVia threw before the target
was written. Opening the picked file for writing is allowed, so fall back to an
in-place write there. Gated on OpenHarmony, so every other platform keeps the
untouched-on-failure contract.

diff --git a/packages/electron-utils/src/atomic-write.ts b/packages/electron-utils/src/atomic-write.ts
